WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.300
"My Rival and Me" (Episode 4)

3
00:42.980 --> 00:44.740
Putting out cigarettes with your fingers?

4
00:45.060 --> 00:46.660
Think you've mastered Iron Palm kung fu?

5
00:50.860 --> 00:51.860
There.

6
00:52.060 --> 00:54.140
This medicine works best on burns.

7
00:54.540 --> 00:55.300
Doesn't hurt now, right?

8
00:55.380 --> 00:57.180
Yeah. It works well.

9
01:05.660 --> 01:07.380
What medicine is this?

10
01:07.860 --> 01:08.940
American cockroach extract.

11
01:13.700 --> 01:15.100
Don't discriminate against species.

12
01:15.540 --> 01:18.340
I used it for burns when I worked at a hotpot restaurant.

13
01:18.364 --> 01:19.444
Put it on, and you're good.

14
01:20.500 --> 01:22.380
You worked at a hotpot restaurant too?

15
01:22.820 --> 01:23.420
Yeah.

16
01:23.700 --> 01:25.580
I've worked all sorts of jobs.

17
01:25.780 --> 01:28.900
Fruit shops, bakeries, cafes. You name it.

18
01:30.980 --> 01:32.180
What about your parents?

19
01:33.500 --> 01:35.620
My mom was too busy working to look after me.

20
01:35.700 --> 01:36.700
My dad...

21
01:37.060 --> 01:38.740
That's a whole other story.

22
01:43.460 --> 01:45.100
So that's why.

23
02:15.180 --> 02:19.020
Our veteran artist really loves his cigarettes.

24
02:21.060 --> 02:24.380
Yet you wanted to spend 30 million on my PR?

25
02:26.540 --> 02:27.940
You think I was lying?

26
02:27.980 --> 02:29.340
I really wanted to help.

27
02:29.620 --> 02:32.100
I've earned quite a bit from acting.

28
02:32.380 --> 02:33.740
Not 30 million yet,

29
02:33.980 --> 02:35.060
but give me some time.

30
02:46.900 --> 02:49.380
Why does he look so troubled?

31
02:49.420 --> 02:52.940
Even promising to study acting with him won't help?

32
02:53.660 --> 02:59.580
Is this a veteran artist's unwavering dedication?

33
03:00.580 --> 03:01.580
Stop smoking.

34
03:02.420 --> 03:03.940
If you really don't want to,

35
03:04.860 --> 03:05.900
then forget it.

36
03:05.900 --> 03:07.420
Don't force yourself.

37
03:25.700 --> 03:26.700
I'm not.

38
03:28.180 --> 03:29.180
It's settled.

39
03:29.580 --> 03:30.580
Huh?

40
03:44.660 --> 03:45.740
I'll handle it from now on.

41
03:57.900 --> 03:59.380
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

42
04:04.020 --> 04:06.420
I've never done this before,

43
04:08.980 --> 04:12.100
so I may not be very good at it.

44
04:13.740 --> 04:17.620
I don't really know the rules either.

45
04:18.740 --> 04:21.260
Anything I should watch out for?

46
04:21.900 --> 04:23.500
It's not that serious.

47
04:23.540 --> 04:25.380
Just...

48
04:26.020 --> 04:27.860
Treat you like a boyfriend?

49
04:30.180 --> 04:32.820
No need! That's going too far.

50
04:33.020 --> 04:34.740
What you're doing now is great.

51
04:34.940 --> 04:36.420
You're doing really well already.

52
04:38.380 --> 04:39.620
Just this

53
04:41.020 --> 04:43.460
counts as doing well?

54
04:47.140 --> 04:48.340
Isn't it good enough?

55
04:48.780 --> 04:52.100
A veteran artist has high standards.

56
04:52.180 --> 04:54.620
Even his fanservice has to be perfect.

57
04:58.020 --> 04:59.180
I'll work hard

58
05:02.020 --> 05:03.020
to do better.

59
05:09.500 --> 05:11.500
I just need to treat you like a boyfriend.

60
05:12.820 --> 05:15.860
Why is he hung up on this boyfriend thing?

61
05:15.940 --> 05:18.340
Do straight guys not know their own strength?

62
05:20.420 --> 05:21.740
I guess that works.

63
05:29.269 --> 05:30.436
[Product Letter of Intent]

64
05:31.860 --> 05:32.860
In other ways,

65
05:33.900 --> 05:36.780
there's probably not much I can do for you.

66
05:37.460 --> 05:39.460
Here's my schedule for the second half of the year.

67
05:40.140 --> 05:41.740
Any opportunities you want?

68
05:41.980 --> 05:43.380
I'll have the company arrange them.

69
05:44.940 --> 05:45.940
Me?

70
05:47.620 --> 05:49.380
Do you have enough money?

71
05:49.900 --> 05:51.260
Anything you want to buy?

72
05:51.420 --> 05:52.420
I'll buy it for you.

73
05:53.300 --> 05:55.180
Did you get the wrong script?

74
05:55.260 --> 05:55.940
Huh?

75
05:56.060 --> 05:57.980
This is beyond boyfriend territory.

76
05:58.060 --> 05:59.340
You're being a sugar daddy.

77
06:03.700 --> 06:05.620
If that's what you want to call me,

78
06:07.580 --> 06:08.180
that's fine.

79
06:08.220 --> 06:09.820
I'm your dad too, you know.

80
06:11.300 --> 06:14.220
Do we have to get this wild?

81
06:18.660 --> 06:21.060
I feel some mysterious force

82
06:21.460 --> 06:23.340
attacking my brain.

83
06:27.660 --> 06:28.700
Where are you going?

84
06:28.820 --> 06:29.820
To close the window.

85
06:31.300 --> 06:33.540
The wind's giving you a headache.

86
06:42.260 --> 06:42.900
Oh.

87
06:42.940 --> 06:45.500
Xiao Chen told me to go to bed half an hour ago.

88
06:45.580 --> 06:47.380
You get some sleep. I'll leave you alone.

89
06:49.100 --> 06:51.980
Shall I bring you breakfast tomorrow?

90
06:52.180 --> 06:54.060
No need. Xiao Chen will get it.

91
06:54.460 --> 06:57.580
Then I'll bring you a drink after work.

92
06:58.180 --> 07:00.020
Honey tea or milk tea?

93
07:00.140 --> 07:03.260
No need. Xiao Chen will buy it.

94
07:06.100 --> 07:07.380
Then what am I for?

95
07:09.180 --> 07:11.860
Your time is precious, right?

96
07:12.060 --> 07:14.260
And I pay Xiao Chen a salary.

97
07:14.940 --> 07:16.900
Fine. I'll pay his salary.

98
07:19.780 --> 07:25.020
Then I'll pay your assistant's salary.

99
07:25.820 --> 07:27.460
How could I let you pay?

100
07:27.540 --> 07:29.180
Isn't this what I should be doing?

101
07:29.300 --> 07:32.660
He really is acting like a boyfriend.

102
07:32.740 --> 07:35.740
Is he the kind of actor who stays in character

103
07:35.820 --> 07:38.860
and keeps our chemistry going off camera too?

104
07:40.540 --> 07:42.020
I can't just take things from you.

105
07:42.140 --> 07:43.220
It's settled.

106
07:43.260 --> 07:45.260
Send me your assistant's payment details.

107
07:45.260 --> 07:46.980
I'll get going. Bye.

108
07:50.300 --> 07:51.300
Bye.

109
07:57.740 --> 07:59.780
Why is Gu Yiliang so strange today?

110
08:00.540 --> 08:01.580
Is he tired?

111
08:02.420 --> 08:03.460
I suppose so.

112
08:03.940 --> 08:05.900
A lot did happen today.

113
08:07.140 --> 08:08.140
Still,

114
08:09.580 --> 08:13.940
night is Mr. Wei's busiest time of day.

115
08:14.460 --> 08:16.420
After a hard day's work,

116
08:16.460 --> 08:18.620
our hardworking Master Wei

117
08:18.660 --> 08:22.900
finally sits down to his real feast.

118
08:24.900 --> 08:26.260
I'll just enjoy a little shipping.

119
08:26.420 --> 08:27.260
Really.

120
08:27.340 --> 08:29.380
I have my own pace.

121
08:33.980 --> 08:34.500
Get ready.

122
08:34.540 --> 08:35.340
A bowl?

123
08:35.540 --> 08:37.420
Shippers feast. We don't suffer.

124
08:37.460 --> 08:38.180
New ship evidence!

125
08:38.180 --> 08:40.036
When Yanzi lowers his right hand, Yiliang's left arm moves.

126
08:40.060 --> 08:41.140
They may be holding hands!

127
08:41.140 --> 08:43.140
Shipping and creating at once. Elite work!

128
08:43.140 --> 08:45.420
Emergency! Emergency!

129
08:46.420 --> 08:47.980
Yanzi's suit covered him up all day.

130
08:48.100 --> 08:49.260
A collarbone bite by night!

131
08:49.300 --> 08:49.780
Huh?

132
08:49.820 --> 08:50.260
Really?

133
08:50.300 --> 08:50.540
Huh?

134
08:50.540 --> 08:51.300
Maybe Yanzi

135
08:51.300 --> 08:52.740
just scratched himself by accident.

136
08:52.740 --> 08:54.780
I've really been trying to hold back!

137
08:55.020 --> 08:56.260
Even the gods can't convince me

138
08:56.260 --> 08:58.900
that mosquito isn't called Gu Yiliang!

139
09:01.020 --> 09:02.100
In 60 minutes,

140
09:02.140 --> 09:03.820
27 instances of physical contact

141
09:03.900 --> 09:05.540
and 163 exchanged glances.

142
09:05.700 --> 09:08.900
The calculated probability that Niangzi is real:

143
09:09.060 --> 09:11.020
99 percent.

144
09:11.140 --> 09:12.140
So,

145
09:15.500 --> 09:16.500
so,

146
09:16.940 --> 09:18.020
Niangzi is real!

147
09:18.020 --> 09:19.740
Niangzi is real now!

148
09:19.740 --> 09:20.660
Niangzi is real!

149
09:20.660 --> 09:22.060
Niangzi is real hot!

150
09:22.340 --> 09:23.260
Niangzi is real!

151
09:23.260 --> 09:24.820
Niangzi is real, right!

152
09:24.900 --> 09:28.180
Sweetness every day, every year!

153
09:28.420 --> 09:31.700
Sweetness every day, every year!

154
09:33.260 --> 09:34.260
Dig in!

155
09:34.340 --> 09:36.620
Serving up sweetness!

156
09:38.340 --> 09:39.900
Gu Yiliang!

157
09:41.380 --> 09:42.620
Real!

158
10:01.220 --> 10:02.220
Douya,

159
10:02.300 --> 10:03.420
help me record this.

160
10:04.020 --> 10:05.900
Certainly.

161
10:15.580 --> 10:18.580
I've become my rival's sugar daddy.

162
10:18.940 --> 10:20.580
Can you teach me

163
10:21.460 --> 10:22.660
how to keep someone?

164
10:22.740 --> 10:27.020
Such arrangements violate public morals and social norms.

165
10:27.100 --> 10:28.780
If you need assistance,

166
10:28.860 --> 10:31.740
I can suggest ways to improve your personal charm

167
10:31.820 --> 10:33.380
and build healthy relationships.

168
10:57.180 --> 11:00.980
Green City's latest sugar-daddy anthology.

169
11:01.580 --> 11:02.620
What's this?

170
11:13.060 --> 11:14.060
Let's break up.

171
11:14.420 --> 11:15.580
I won't break up with you.

172
11:16.580 --> 11:18.060
I'm bankrupt.

173
11:18.580 --> 11:19.580
Leave.

174
11:20.900 --> 11:22.140
I can't support you anymore.

175
11:23.380 --> 11:24.420
I'm not leaving.

176
11:25.580 --> 11:27.180
I don't want your money.

177
11:27.540 --> 11:28.540
I'll support you.

178
11:28.540 --> 11:30.340
Let me be your sugar daddy, okay?

179
11:31.900 --> 11:34.820
I'm very expensive to keep.

180
11:35.460 --> 11:36.620
I know.

181
11:37.540 --> 11:38.540
One hundred million,

182
11:39.140 --> 11:40.140
one billion,

183
11:40.860 --> 11:42.300
or ten billion,

184
11:42.780 --> 11:44.020
you can have it all.

185
11:47.340 --> 11:49.140
I knew you loved me.

186
11:49.860 --> 11:51.620
I love you so much.

187
11:53.860 --> 11:56.460
But why are we so far apart?

188
11:59.340 --> 12:03.540
The website bans physical contact below the neck.

189
12:05.660 --> 12:07.820
What a tragic pair of lovers.

190
12:09.620 --> 12:11.060
I was prejudiced.

191
12:12.060 --> 12:15.220
I thought being kept was a terrible thing.

192
12:16.220 --> 12:20.460
Such pure love can exist in this kind of arrangement!

193
12:26.420 --> 12:27.940
Flower Market's sugar-daddy anthology.

194
12:28.060 --> 12:30.300
An advanced tutorial?

195
12:36.700 --> 12:40.980
Say that again.

196
12:41.980 --> 12:42.980
I said

197
12:43.300 --> 12:44.740
I'm ending our arrangement.

198
12:48.540 --> 12:51.060
I can tolerate your little tantrums,

199
12:51.740 --> 12:53.780
but ending this on your own?

200
12:54.980 --> 12:55.980
Impossible.

201
12:56.140 --> 12:58.100
Gu Yiliang, don't forget,

202
12:58.260 --> 12:59.900
this is just a sugar-daddy arrangement.

203
13:00.500 --> 13:01.820
Just an arrangement?

204
13:02.460 --> 13:03.460
Hmph.

205
13:04.140 --> 13:06.060
Let go of me! What are you doing?

206
13:06.140 --> 13:06.780
Let go!

207
13:06.780 --> 13:07.820
I'm your sugar daddy.

208
13:08.420 --> 13:09.540
You don't get to decide

209
13:09.580 --> 13:10.620
what we are.

210
13:10.860 --> 13:12.220
Let go of me!

211
13:13.740 --> 13:15.460
Let go! This is...

212
13:16.940 --> 13:17.940
A crime!

213
13:23.140 --> 13:24.140
A crime!

214
13:24.380 --> 13:25.740
This is a crime!

215
13:28.420 --> 13:30.780
This world is way too complicated.

216
13:31.340 --> 13:32.500
I'm his sugar daddy.

217
13:32.660 --> 13:34.420
I have an absolute duty to protect him.

218
13:37.260 --> 13:38.260
Oh, come on.

219
13:39.300 --> 13:42.380
Fiction exaggerates things.

220
13:42.940 --> 13:44.820
This could never happen in real life...

221
14:42.300 --> 14:43.300
That's enough.

222
14:44.420 --> 14:45.860
We're in your office!

223
14:46.260 --> 14:47.620
Wasn't this what you wanted?

224
14:48.060 --> 14:49.460
I didn't want to die!

225
14:49.940 --> 14:51.220
Are you trying to kill me?

226
14:51.980 --> 14:53.060
We could try.

227
14:59.460 --> 15:00.460
Mr. Gu.

228
15:01.140 --> 15:01.940
Is Mr. Cheng in?

229
15:02.020 --> 15:03.660
Yes, he is.

230
15:03.740 --> 15:05.220
All right. I'll go see him myself.

231
15:10.980 --> 15:11.980
Who is it?

232
15:12.420 --> 15:13.420
Gu Yiliang.

233
15:17.740 --> 15:19.820
Cheng, you dog! Are you crazy?

234
15:20.300 --> 15:21.300
Let go of me!

235
15:25.420 --> 15:27.020
Let go!

236
15:27.980 --> 15:30.420
Boss, I was wrong.

237
15:30.660 --> 15:32.820
Please let me off this once.

238
15:44.460 --> 15:45.460
What is it?

239
15:45.620 --> 15:47.660
It's about my upcoming work schedule.

240
15:47.980 --> 15:48.980
I'd like to discuss it.

241
15:50.740 --> 15:51.740
Let's talk over there.

242
15:51.740 --> 15:52.740
No need.

243
15:53.340 --> 15:54.420
I'll leave when I'm done.

244
15:56.220 --> 15:57.220
Go ahead.

245
15:57.500 --> 15:58.700
I'd like

246
15:58.780 --> 16:02.020
some of my opportunities redirected to Wei Yanzi's team.

247
16:02.940 --> 16:05.660
Do you know what you're saying?

248
16:06.060 --> 16:08.380
Wei Yanzi's acting needs work,

249
16:08.780 --> 16:11.020
but his fashion presence and variety-show skills

250
16:11.020 --> 16:12.580
are the strongest among his peers.

251
16:13.180 --> 16:16.740
He just needs more exposure and opportunities.

252
16:18.460 --> 16:20.380
You barely know him, don't you?

253
16:21.140 --> 16:22.620
In what capacity are you helping him?

254
16:22.980 --> 16:24.060
I

255
16:25.700 --> 16:27.060
should tell you.

256
16:27.540 --> 16:30.140
I'm his sugar daddy now.

257
16:30.820 --> 16:32.260
I'm just doing what I should.

258
16:32.420 --> 16:35.420
Holy shit, that's huge gossip!

259
16:36.380 --> 16:38.340
I know it's sudden,

260
16:38.740 --> 16:39.860
but I've thought it through.

261
16:40.260 --> 16:43.380
Redirecting opportunities doesn't mean I'll slack off.

262
16:43.940 --> 16:46.700
I just think some of my current engagements

263
16:47.340 --> 16:50.780
would work better with Wei Yanzi.

264
16:51.140 --> 16:52.140
It's a win-win.

265
16:54.740 --> 16:56.340
Does Wei Yanzi know

266
16:56.740 --> 16:58.220
you're giving up these opportunities?

267
16:58.860 --> 17:00.060
Not yet.

268
17:00.820 --> 17:03.220
I'd like you to keep it secret for now.

269
17:03.980 --> 17:07.380
Are you sure you shouldn't discuss it with him?

270
17:17.460 --> 17:18.460
All right.

271
17:18.940 --> 17:19.940
I'll agree.

272
17:20.820 --> 17:23.500
You are Hengtu's cash cow, after all.

273
17:24.580 --> 17:27.060
Thanks. I'll leave you to it.

274
17:29.620 --> 17:30.620
Wait.

275
17:32.180 --> 17:33.180
Gu Yiliang,

276
17:34.340 --> 17:35.900
as your and Wei Yanzi's boss,

277
17:37.060 --> 17:39.420
I'm glad you're getting along.

278
17:39.820 --> 17:40.980
But as a friend,

279
17:41.700 --> 17:43.700
I have to remind you of something.

280
17:44.620 --> 17:48.700
There's no unbreakable love in this industry.

281
17:49.980 --> 17:53.100
And fanservice partners don't become real couples overnight.

282
17:53.180 --> 17:55.100
At least Gu Yiliang isn't stingy.

283
17:55.140 --> 17:57.260
He's giving Wei Yanzi real, valuable opportunities.

284
17:57.300 --> 17:59.540
A hundred times better than Cheng the dog.

285
18:02.020 --> 18:03.020
Thank you.

286
18:03.340 --> 18:04.500
But I've made up my mind.

287
18:24.900 --> 18:26.020
Shit.

288
18:35.540 --> 18:37.100
I'm barely alive.

289
18:37.700 --> 18:41.460
Two hours of charging, a full day of work.

290
18:41.780 --> 18:44.700
Yanzi, you've got a few more engagements.

291
18:44.740 --> 18:46.940
Your career is really taking off!

292
18:47.460 --> 18:48.540
More?

293
18:49.900 --> 18:51.860
The old man pulled strings again?

294
18:54.740 --> 18:55.380
Huh?

295
18:55.500 --> 18:56.220
So tired.

296
18:56.220 --> 18:56.740
Mr. Gu.

297
18:56.740 --> 18:57.740
Haven't had breakfast?

298
19:00.020 --> 19:01.020
Iced honey tea.

299
19:01.660 --> 19:02.980
Drink it after you eat.

300
19:03.340 --> 19:04.340
Have something first,

301
19:04.620 --> 19:05.676
or you'll upset your stomach.

302
19:05.700 --> 19:06.700
Oh.

303
19:11.020 --> 19:12.180
Look!

304
19:12.260 --> 19:13.820
Our fandom's finest creator,

305
19:13.900 --> 19:16.020
feeding us first thing in the morning!

306
19:18.340 --> 19:19.340
Eat first.

307
19:20.100 --> 19:21.140
Okay.

308
19:22.980 --> 19:24.140
It's not for us.

309
19:32.220 --> 19:34.100
Eat up. It's warm, not hot.

310
19:35.020 --> 19:36.356
You're being so thoughtful, Mr. Gu.

311
19:36.380 --> 19:38.100
Then let me return the favor. Here.

312
19:44.820 --> 19:45.820
Here.

313
19:49.540 --> 19:50.540
Here.

314
19:56.660 --> 19:57.660
Eat.

315
20:17.260 --> 20:18.260
Mr. Gu,

316
20:18.940 --> 20:20.020
what does this mean?

317
20:40.220 --> 20:43.380
Something about him feels different today.

318
20:43.460 --> 20:44.860
Every movement,

319
20:44.940 --> 20:47.900
every inch of him radiates boyfriend energy.

320
20:49.220 --> 20:50.780
Let's go to the set together.

321
20:52.300 --> 20:53.540
I'll rehearse with you.

322
20:54.020 --> 20:55.020
Let's get it in one take.

323
20:55.260 --> 20:56.260
Okay.

324
20:56.340 --> 20:57.260
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

325
20:57.260 --> 20:58.260
Yeah.

326
20:59.060 --> 21:01.140
It's like watching fanfiction.

327
21:08.820 --> 21:11.380
What's fanfiction?

328
21:12.380 --> 21:15.460
Fanfiction is fiction.

329
21:15.900 --> 21:17.420
Yes. Novels. Just novels.

330
21:21.260 --> 21:23.980
Do you read novels, Mr. Gu?

331
21:25.860 --> 21:26.860
No.

332
21:27.540 --> 21:28.340
I don't know much about them.

333
21:28.500 --> 21:29.540
Neither do I.

334
21:45.300 --> 21:45.980
We're here!

335
21:46.060 --> 21:47.060
We're really sorry.

336
21:47.580 --> 21:48.860
Our last scene ran late.

337
21:48.860 --> 21:50.060
We came as soon as we wrapped.

338
21:50.340 --> 21:51.340
I'm sorry.

339
21:51.420 --> 21:52.420
Sorry.

340
21:53.340 --> 21:55.660
If filming's so important, skip the magazine shoot.

341
21:57.140 --> 21:58.236
This is the only outfit left.

342
21:58.260 --> 21:59.500
Get changed and made up. Hurry.

343
22:00.060 --> 22:00.620
Oh.

344
22:00.700 --> 22:01.700
Hurry up.

345
22:01.740 --> 22:02.740
Okay.

346
22:08.380 --> 22:09.660
This color

347
22:10.700 --> 22:11.700
looks pretty good.

348
22:18.340 --> 22:20.420
I look like a boss-babe saleswoman.

349
22:26.700 --> 22:27.740
Still not ready?

350
22:31.260 --> 22:34.140
Welcome to the Meiyan Boss-Babe Business Club!

351
22:38.340 --> 22:39.716
Did you bring any of your own clothes?

352
22:39.740 --> 22:40.740
No.

353
22:40.820 --> 22:42.540
I rushed over. I didn't bring anything.

354
22:55.580 --> 22:56.580
The trousers are fine.

355
22:56.700 --> 22:57.940
Wear this jacket.

356
22:58.380 --> 23:00.340
We're doing this as the "Lan Jue" leads.

357
23:00.460 --> 23:01.780
Matching styles will do.

358
23:02.500 --> 23:02.980
Yeah.

359
23:03.220 --> 23:07.140
That damn boyfriend energy.

360
23:07.260 --> 23:08.740
I couldn't impose.

361
23:18.500 --> 23:20.220
Your shoulders are a bit narrower than mine.

362
23:20.420 --> 23:21.940
Just wear it oversized.

363
23:22.660 --> 23:24.140
For the photos, you can take it off

364
23:24.380 --> 23:25.380
over your shoulders.

365
23:33.420 --> 23:34.420
What's wrong?

366
23:35.100 --> 23:36.100
Nothing.

367
23:36.180 --> 23:38.420
Don't spare me just because I'm delicate.

368
23:38.500 --> 23:40.660
Give me sweetness! Drown me in it!

369
23:41.180 --> 23:42.180
Thank you.

370
23:42.740 --> 23:44.060
You're welcome.

371
23:48.780 --> 23:49.860
Too loose.

372
23:50.900 --> 23:52.220
Just right.

373
23:57.140 --> 23:59.380
Sorry. I overestimated myself.

374
23:59.460 --> 24:02.500
I can't handle sweetness on this scale!

375
24:05.020 --> 24:06.020
Great work, everyone.

376
24:06.020 --> 24:06.780
Thank you.

377
24:06.900 --> 24:07.900
Thanks, everyone.

378
24:08.860 --> 24:09.780
Take a short break over there.

379
24:09.860 --> 24:10.460
Okay.

380
24:10.540 --> 24:11.220
I'll check your photos.

381
24:11.260 --> 24:12.260
Okay.

382
24:17.860 --> 24:18.900
Mr. Gu.

383
24:18.940 --> 24:20.020
Mr. Wei.

384
24:25.220 --> 24:26.420
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

385
24:28.180 --> 24:29.540
No herbal tea,

386
24:29.620 --> 24:31.180
so have a drink to restore your health.

387
24:31.620 --> 24:32.700
Oh, right.

388
24:33.460 --> 24:35.540
Let me buy this ring from you.

389
24:35.740 --> 24:36.740
Why?

390
24:37.580 --> 24:39.140
I really like this brand,

391
24:39.580 --> 24:40.860
and I couldn't get this design.

392
24:40.900 --> 24:41.500
So, maybe...

393
24:41.540 --> 24:42.540
It's yours.

394
24:43.660 --> 24:44.660
It's yours.

395
24:44.780 --> 24:45.980
No, no!

396
24:46.060 --> 24:47.756
This ring costs tens of thousands. It's expensive!

397
24:47.780 --> 24:48.980
I've never given you a gift.

398
24:49.380 --> 24:50.660
I really shouldn't.

399
24:50.980 --> 24:51.980
Here, take it back.

400
25:09.700 --> 25:10.740
Mr. Gu,

401
25:11.780 --> 25:13.460
am I a Christmas tree?

402
25:17.260 --> 25:18.900
What is all this?

403
25:19.060 --> 25:21.220
The Fall 2024 collection.

404
25:21.220 --> 25:23.220
No, I mean,

405
25:24.660 --> 25:25.700
what are you doing?

406
25:26.900 --> 25:28.340
You said you liked this brand.

407
25:28.780 --> 25:30.260
No, what I meant was...

408
25:30.340 --> 25:31.340
It's all yours.

409
25:31.460 --> 25:32.460
As long as you like it.

410
25:36.180 --> 25:39.340
He's definitely put a spell on me.

411
25:44.260 --> 25:45.340
No need, Mr. Gu.

412
25:45.940 --> 25:47.820
I'm grateful you lent me the ring and clothes.

413
25:47.820 --> 25:48.860
Really grateful.

414
25:49.060 --> 25:50.340
You don't need to spend so much.

415
25:51.540 --> 25:52.700
Yanzi, you're up next.

416
25:52.740 --> 25:53.420
Get ready.

417
25:53.540 --> 25:55.660
Mr. Gu, I've got to go.

418
25:55.900 --> 25:56.300
Oh, right.

419
25:56.340 --> 25:58.780
I'll buy this ring after all.

420
25:59.260 --> 26:00.700
It appeared on camera today.

421
26:00.740 --> 26:02.300
I'll have Xiao Chen pay your assistant.

422
26:02.660 --> 26:03.660
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

423
26:14.940 --> 26:17.060
Am I going about this the wrong way?

424
26:23.420 --> 26:24.420
Herbal tea.

425
26:35.660 --> 26:37.340
I just need to treat you like a boyfriend.

426
26:37.540 --> 26:38.140
Okay.

427
26:38.260 --> 26:39.380
I'll pay his salary.

428
26:41.220 --> 26:42.340
Just right.

429
26:43.100 --> 26:44.700
Am I a Christmas tree?

430
26:44.860 --> 26:45.860
It's all yours.

431
26:46.060 --> 26:47.060
As long as you like it.

432
26:58.100 --> 26:59.100
Wait.

433
26:59.540 --> 27:00.540
What's wrong?

434
27:01.660 --> 27:02.340
Xiao Chen,

435
27:02.460 --> 27:04.380
are there any temples nearby?

436
27:05.420 --> 27:06.420
A temple?

437
27:06.580 --> 27:07.860
Actually, I think there is one.

438
27:08.060 --> 27:09.236
It's supposed to be quite powerful.

439
27:09.260 --> 27:10.260
Want your fortune told?

440
27:11.340 --> 27:13.260
I think

441
27:14.420 --> 27:15.700
I've been bewitched.

442
27:16.140 --> 27:16.660
I need to pray.

443
27:16.740 --> 27:18.300
Don't scare me!

444
27:18.620 --> 27:20.140
Who cursed you? A hater?

445
27:22.180 --> 27:23.540
Most likely,

446
27:24.580 --> 27:26.260
my own resolve wavered,

447
27:26.820 --> 27:28.940
and I did it to myself.

448
27:30.860 --> 27:31.860
Have some more.

449
27:33.020 --> 27:33.940
I'll drive you there.

450
27:33.980 --> 27:34.500
No need.

451
27:34.580 --> 27:35.980
Walking shows more devotion.

452
27:43.100 --> 27:44.100
Mr. Gu,

453
27:44.700 --> 27:46.140
why are you here alone?

454
27:46.300 --> 27:47.300
Where's Mr. Wei?

455
27:48.540 --> 27:49.940
Yanzi left.

456
27:50.220 --> 27:52.020
He said he was tired after the shoot.

457
27:52.540 --> 27:53.540
Tired?

458
27:53.940 --> 27:55.300
Yeah. Worn out.

459
27:55.660 --> 27:58.620
He's tired of me already?

460
27:59.220 --> 28:00.980
What... what else did he say?

461
28:01.580 --> 28:04.179
He thinks someone's put...

462
28:05.940 --> 28:06.700
Put off?

463
28:06.940 --> 28:08.100
Something like that.

464
28:08.740 --> 28:09.740
Then he asked me

465
28:09.820 --> 28:11.140
if there were any temples nearby.

466
28:11.740 --> 28:12.860
He wanted to clear his head.

467
28:19.500 --> 28:21.980
Even as my sugar daddy, Gu Yiliang copies novel characters.

468
28:22.100 --> 28:24.180
He's just going through the motions.

469
28:24.900 --> 28:26.140
All that sweet talk,

470
28:26.260 --> 28:28.660
but he's a jerk playing with my feelings.

471
28:28.740 --> 28:29.740
What a turnoff.

472
28:30.060 --> 28:32.260
Please sever the bond between us.

473
28:36.180 --> 28:37.220
Which temple did he go to?

474
28:37.380 --> 28:38.380
The one nearby.

475
28:40.260 --> 28:41.780
Xiao Zhang, you head back.

476
28:42.420 --> 28:44.580
Yiliang, should I drive you?

477
28:45.460 --> 28:47.980
Walking shows more devotion.

478
28:49.340 --> 28:50.420
Let's have dinner together.

479
28:54.780 --> 28:55.780
Which restaurant?

480
29:21.980 --> 29:23.980
Eating so much, kitty?

481
29:24.060 --> 29:26.580
Your tummy's all round.

482
29:26.780 --> 29:28.020
What an appetite.

483
29:28.580 --> 29:29.700
Such a good kitty.

484
29:47.540 --> 29:48.580
Gu Yiliang?

485
29:48.940 --> 29:49.940
What are you doing here?

486
29:50.740 --> 29:51.460
We're done filming.

487
29:51.580 --> 29:53.020
Xiao Chen said you were here,

488
29:54.140 --> 29:55.180
so I came to see you.

489
30:00.660 --> 30:01.860
Is there something on my face?

490
30:06.260 --> 30:10.460
Are you... angry?

491
30:11.580 --> 30:12.820
Angry about what?

492
30:13.380 --> 30:14.620
What did Xiao Chen tell you?

493
30:14.900 --> 30:15.900
That I've become a monk?

494
30:19.380 --> 30:20.500
Did he really say that?

495
30:20.860 --> 30:22.540
Well, no.

496
30:23.140 --> 30:24.180
It's just...

497
30:27.100 --> 30:28.740
What suddenly made you come here?

498
30:29.180 --> 30:29.820
I...

499
30:30.140 --> 30:32.340
I can't say I came to a temple

500
30:32.420 --> 30:34.260
because my fanservice partner's been too sweet,

501
30:34.300 --> 30:35.396
giving me an irregular heartbeat,

502
30:35.420 --> 30:37.060
and I need to cleanse my worldly desires.

503
30:39.020 --> 30:40.740
Or that I'm here because

504
30:40.820 --> 30:42.436
my fanservice partner's smile is too beautiful,

505
30:42.460 --> 30:44.220
and I'm afraid I'll lose control.

506
30:45.553 --> 30:47.033
And I definitely can't say...

507
30:47.940 --> 30:50.860
it's because I'm Beijing's Buddhist prince.

508
30:52.420 --> 30:55.540
So that's your style.

509
30:56.900 --> 30:57.980
Oh, forget it.

510
30:58.060 --> 30:58.900
Since we're here,

511
30:59.020 --> 31:00.420
want to go inside and pray with me?

512
31:00.860 --> 31:01.460
Sure.

513
31:01.620 --> 31:02.620
Let's go.

514
31:02.900 --> 31:04.100
Eat up, kitty.

515
31:05.500 --> 31:06.500
Eat up.

516
31:24.540 --> 31:27.500
These offerings are a little strange.

517
31:34.060 --> 31:37.260
Is it really appropriate for us to pray here?

518
31:38.940 --> 31:43.386
[Guanyin, the Goddess of Mercy, grants all requests for children.]

519
31:45.880 --> 31:47.240
Bonus Content 4: Enjoying The Ship

520
31:50.866 --> 31:53.980
Gu Yiliang! What are you doing? Go!

521
31:55.500 --> 31:59.513
Niangzi is real!

522
33:14.060 --> 33:15.060
Watch out.

523
33:16.426 --> 33:19.086
But you don't have to study them. You're fine the way you are.

524
33:21.526 --> 33:22.946
From now on, I'll get one for you.

525
33:24.306 --> 33:27.773
AI will only replace cream puffs like me. A talented actor like you will keep going.

526
33:28.373 --> 33:29.766
You'll act into old age.
